    "summary": "ImageMagick has an off-by-one error in MSL decoder could result in crash",
    "details": "ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. In versions below 7.1.2-19, an off by one error in the MSL decoder could result in a crash when a malicous MSL file is read. This issue has been fixed in version 7.1.2-19.",
